message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: scigantic-bil
abstract: "Search the Brain Image Library and read light-sheet, fMOST, STPT and tracing volumes (TIFF, OME-TIFF, JPEG 2000, OME-Zarr) over HTTP without downloading them. Provides a typed catalog over BIL's daily inventory and metadata API, lazy file listing, single-slice TIFF reads and OME-Zarr access."
authors:
  - name: Scigantic
    website: https://scigantic.com
